<title>JAPAN: Japan 2-yr note auction lowest price 99.82.</title>
<headline>Japan 2-yr note auction lowest price 99.82.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction of 120 billion yen</p>
<p>two-year government notes produced the following results, the</p>
<p>Ministry of Finance said on Thursday:</p>
<p>Lowest price	 99.82    Stop rate	  1.091 pct</p>
<p>Average price	99.87    Average yield    1.065 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   231.6 billion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	118.6 billion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 70.0000 pct</p>
<p>Issue date	  July 22, 1997   Maturity    July 21, 1999</p>
<p>Coupon payment     January 20, July 20</p>
</text>
